1
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:13,130
[Episode 13]

2
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:56,480
Then go back to Australia.

3
00:00:56,480 --> 00:01:00,150
If it's that pretty, go to your country
and live happily.

4
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:02,860
How would it feel to be up there?

5
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:07,190
Would it look much better than it does from here?

6
00:01:07,190 --> 00:01:10,260
If you're so curious, then why don't you go?

7
00:01:10,260 --> 00:01:11,920
I am going.

8
00:01:14,750 --> 00:01:19,900
I'll be going there soon.

9
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:33,150
You and I weren't meant to be this time around.

10
00:01:34,530 --> 00:01:37,270
Let's meet in the next life.

11
00:01:52,890 --> 00:01:56,070
The Rose of Sharon is in bloom.

12
00:01:58,140 --> 00:02:00,400
The Rose of Sharon is in bloom.

13
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:03,740
Uncle! You moved!

14
00:02:03,740 --> 00:02:06,090
You're it!

15
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:10,450
Ready?

16
00:02:10,450 --> 00:02:13,220
The Rose of Sharon is in bloom!

17
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:21,210
The Rose of Sharon is in...

18
00:02:21,210 --> 00:02:22,500
Bloomed!

19
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:42,250
What's wrong?

20
00:02:42,250 --> 00:02:44,360
What's wrong, Eunchae?

21
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:46,110
What happened?

22
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,310
What is it?

23
00:02:57,770 --> 00:03:01,860
Eunchae! What happened? Huh?

24
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,670
Eunchae!

25
00:03:23,650 --> 00:03:25,690
Eunchae! Eunchae!

26
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,660
Eunchae!

27
00:03:30,010 --> 00:03:32,560
Eunchae!

28
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,080
Are you okay?

29
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:42,250
Let's put some medicine on it.
Let's go inside and rub some medicine on it.

30
00:03:42,250 --> 00:03:45,210
Are you hurt anywhere else?

31
00:03:45,210 --> 00:03:48,100
You should be more careful, dummy!

32
00:03:48,100 --> 00:03:49,460
Let go.

33
00:03:52,380 --> 00:03:55,660
I'm fine. I'm fine.

34
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:56,940
Eunchae.

35
00:03:56,940 --> 00:03:59,070
I said I'm fine!

36
00:04:00,230 --> 00:04:02,580
I don't feel a thing!

37
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:14,700
This is nothing. It doesn't hurt.

38
00:04:15,910 --> 00:04:17,470
I'm fine.

39
00:04:25,230 --> 00:04:27,790
Eunchae got hurt.

40
00:04:27,790 --> 00:04:29,690
She looks like she's hurting. A lot.

41
00:04:29,690 --> 00:04:32,880
What should we do? What should we do?

42
00:07:07,170 --> 00:07:08,510
Eunchae.

43
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:15,010
Eunchae.

44
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:20,540
Why didn't you tell me Muhyeok was sick?

45
00:07:21,710 --> 00:07:24,850
Because you thought I might leave Yun?

46
00:07:24,850 --> 00:07:28,310
Were you afraid I'd go to Muhyeok?
Is that why you didn't tell me?

47
00:07:29,190 --> 00:07:32,100
Did Yun's mother tell you to hide it from me?

48
00:07:37,490 --> 00:07:41,420
Let's go inside. Let's go home.

49
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:50,050
You should have told me.

50
00:07:51,230 --> 00:07:53,640
You should have told me.

51
00:07:55,140 --> 00:08:00,210
Do you know what I did to Muhyeok?

52
00:08:00,210 --> 00:08:03,060
Do you know what I said?

53
00:08:03,060 --> 00:08:07,420
What's wrong with your face? Did you get hurt?

54
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:13,840
You should have told me sooner!

55
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:22,320
Dad, I was so harsh to him.
Do you know how cruel I was to him?

56
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,620
Let's go inside.

57
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:25,890
I'm going to go to Yun.

58
00:08:25,890 --> 00:08:28,470
I'm going to go and tell him

59
00:08:28,470 --> 00:08:32,000
to let me go to Muhyeok at least now.

60
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,300
I'm going to go tell Yun!

61
00:08:33,300 --> 00:08:34,180
Eunchae!

62
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:36,430
I'm going to tell him to let me go to Muhyeok.

63
00:08:36,430 --> 00:08:38,690
I'll beg him to let me go.

64
00:08:38,690 --> 00:08:40,560
- Go inside.
- Dad!

65
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,360
- Eunchae!
- Dad, please let me go!

66
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:45,620
- Dad!
- Let me go!

67
00:08:46,290 --> 00:08:48,650
- Dad!
- Get inside!

68
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:01,790
Why isn't Eunchae home yet?

69
00:09:01,790 --> 00:09:04,000
She's been out forever to get the tofu.

70
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,550
That's what I'm saying.

71
00:09:05,550 --> 00:09:07,950
Maybe she's gone to the bean field
to make the tofu herself.

72
00:09:07,950 --> 00:09:11,620
You don't think someone
put her in his pocket and took her away

73
00:09:11,620 --> 00:09:14,300
because she's so tiny and cute, do you?

74
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:16,400
That's what I'm...

75
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,900
not saying!

76
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:20,530
Mom, you think too highly of your child.

77
00:09:20,530 --> 00:09:23,430
Eunchae is cute, but she's not that cute.

78
00:09:23,430 --> 00:09:24,680
But me, well...

79
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:31,070
I'm so worried. Sukchae, go and find Eunchae.

80
00:09:31,070 --> 00:09:33,740
Hey. You go.

81
00:09:33,740 --> 00:09:35,570
She told you to go.

82
00:09:35,570 --> 00:09:37,260
I don't want to. It's cold.

83
00:09:37,260 --> 00:09:38,830
I ought to just...

84
00:09:38,830 --> 00:09:41,190
How are you always so violent?

85
00:09:41,190 --> 00:09:43,080
Disgusting, disgusting.

86
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:47,500
I feel bad for Eunchae who
has to call you two her siblings!

87
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:54,310
You brats wouldn't even blink an eye if Eunchae died!

88
00:09:54,310 --> 00:09:57,010
What am I going to do with you two?

89
00:09:57,010 --> 00:09:59,840
- Get inside!
- Let go!

90
00:10:00,590 --> 00:10:03,570
- Get inside!
- Dad, please just let go!

91
00:10:03,570 --> 00:10:05,980
- Get inside!
- What are you doing?

92
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:07,360
Dad!

93
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:13,160
I don't want you to take one step out of this room!

94
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:14,770
Dad!

95
00:10:17,190 --> 00:10:18,420
Dad.

96
00:10:19,970 --> 00:10:24,940
I'm not going to let you go to Yun or Muhyeok!

97
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:26,130
Dad!

98
00:10:26,130 --> 00:10:27,670
Don't answer your phone.

99
00:10:29,090 --> 00:10:30,510
Dad!

100
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:36,670
Open the door!

101
00:11:36,670 --> 00:11:39,340
Honey, what's gotten into you?

102
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:45,130
If anyone of you opens this door,
I won't let you get away with it.

103
00:11:47,630 --> 00:11:52,630
It looked like Eunchae was hurt.
She was limping and had scratches.

104
00:11:52,630 --> 00:11:54,840
Don't you think we should at least
give her some ointment?

105
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:57,060
- Sukchae! Minchae!
- Yes?

106
00:11:57,060 --> 00:12:04,300
You two sleep in our room,
and I'll sleep in the living room.

107
00:12:12,100 --> 00:12:17,550
Uh. Dad, my wallet and clothes are in there.

108
00:12:17,550 --> 00:12:18,940
I have a job interview tomorrow.

109
00:12:18,940 --> 00:12:20,350
Don't go!

110
00:12:20,350 --> 00:12:22,440
My bag's in there.

111
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:24,490
I have homework to do and school tomorrow.

112
00:12:24,490 --> 00:12:27,560
Don't go to your interview, and don't go to school!

113
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:32,180
How will she eat?

114
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:36,040
We can't starve her like some criminal.

115
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:38,180
Let her starve.

116
00:12:38,180 --> 00:12:42,090
Are you out of your mind?

117
00:12:42,090 --> 00:12:44,860
What if my Eunchae dies?

118
00:12:44,860 --> 00:12:47,680
Are you about to kill our Eunchae?

119
00:12:47,680 --> 00:12:49,870
She won't die! Don't worry!

120
00:12:52,290 --> 00:12:56,030
Start packing. We're moving.

121
00:12:56,030 --> 00:12:57,780
Move? Where? Why?

122
00:12:57,780 --> 00:13:01,440
Anywhere! Transfer Minchae to a different school!

123
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,380
Dad, you can't do this on short...

124
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:06,600
I'm going to look for a house we
can move into immediately, so pack your bags!

125
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:11,210
I'm warning you again.

126
00:13:11,210 --> 00:13:13,270
If any one of you opens the door for Eunchae...

127
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:18,920
I'll divorce you, and I'll disown you kids!

128
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,410
If you want to test me, do it!

129
00:13:20,410 --> 00:13:23,390
If you get a call from Yun,

130
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:28,270
tell him Eunchae went away and that
you don't know when she'll be back.

131
00:13:35,230 --> 00:13:38,060
Mom, is that person really our father?

132
00:13:38,060 --> 00:13:43,360
What's gotten into him? Was he struck by lightning?

133
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:46,180
Maybe he did get hit by lightning.

134
00:13:46,180 --> 00:13:49,570
It feels like I've been hit by lightning just now!

135
00:13:49,570 --> 00:13:52,190
Oh, dear. Eunchae. Eunchae.

136
00:13:52,190 --> 00:13:58,460
Eunchae, just wait a little.
I'll open the door for you.

137
00:13:58,460 --> 00:14:02,850
Minchae, hammer! Get the hammer!

138
00:14:02,850 --> 00:14:05,120
Mom, do you want to get a divorce?

139
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:07,670
You know dad is a man of his word.

140
00:14:07,670 --> 00:14:09,700
Are you prepared for the consequences?

141
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:17,080
Eunchae, are you okay?

142
00:14:18,490 --> 00:14:21,820
You seemed hurt. Are you okay?

143
00:14:22,940 --> 00:14:25,990
What should we do? I can't even put medicine on it.

144
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:30,860
Where and how much does it hurt? Huh?

145
00:14:30,860 --> 00:14:32,490
Eunchae!

146
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:40,770
You didn't even eat yet. I'm sure you're hungry...

147
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:42,760
What did you do to deserve such punishment?

148
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:46,500
What did you do to make Dad so angry?

149
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,960
Why are you here?

150
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:04,290
I'm here to see Eunchae.

151
00:15:04,290 --> 00:15:06,160
I sent Eunchae to the country.

152
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:08,660
She's not home. You should go.

153
00:15:08,660 --> 00:15:10,310
Please let me see her.

154
00:15:10,310 --> 00:15:13,840
- I said she's not home.
- Please let me see her.

155
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:15,120
Go home.

156
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:32,380
What are you talking about?

157
00:15:32,380 --> 00:15:34,550
Where did Eunchae go?

158
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:37,970
The countryside? Why all of a sudden?

159
00:15:39,270 --> 00:15:42,600
You don't know when she'll be back?

160
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:45,250
Mr. Song... What...

161
00:15:46,250 --> 00:15:47,690
Wait a second.

162
00:15:49,070 --> 00:15:55,410
I know you're mad at me, but you
shouldn't take it out on my sick boy Yun.

163
00:15:55,410 --> 00:15:57,540
You know Yun can't live without Eunchae!

164
00:15:57,540 --> 00:15:59,390
You know that very well,

165
00:15:59,390 --> 00:16:03,330
so don't be so immature about it
and send Eunchae over.

166
00:16:03,330 --> 00:16:06,090
Mr. Song. Mr. Song!

167
00:16:11,030 --> 00:16:12,800
[Song Eunchae]

168
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:18,330
Your call has been forwarded to an...

169
00:16:18,330 --> 00:16:21,570
Eunchae, not you, too.

170
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:28,820
I guess I'll just go to Yeonsu's
and borrow her books for homework.

171
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:31,310
Why don't you wear Mom's clothes to your interview?

172
00:16:31,310 --> 00:16:34,070
We'll be fine, one way or another,

173
00:16:34,070 --> 00:16:36,650
but what about Eunchae being
locked up in our room like that?

174
00:16:36,650 --> 00:16:39,800
How will she go to the bathroom?

175
00:16:39,800 --> 00:16:43,130
Well, she hasn't eaten,
so maybe she won't need to go.

176
00:16:43,130 --> 00:16:47,520
I think Dad's really set on killing Eunchae.

177
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:50,430
You don't think he's really going to kill her, do you?

178
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:55,400
Eunchae's locked up?

179
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:56,850
- No.
- Yes.

180
00:16:58,350 --> 00:17:01,890
No! Eunchae's not home! She went to the country.

181
00:17:01,890 --> 00:17:04,140
No! You can't!

182
00:17:04,140 --> 00:17:06,770
She'll die, my mom's marriage will end up in a divorce,

183
00:17:06,770 --> 00:17:09,280
and we will lose our father!

184
00:17:12,020 --> 00:17:15,320
Please spare us!

185
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:27,550
Eunchae went to the country.
Something important came up.

186
00:18:27,550 --> 00:18:30,090
She'll be back in a couple of days.

187
00:18:30,090 --> 00:18:32,730
She'll be back soon.

188
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:38,390
Should I go home and check?

189
00:18:38,390 --> 00:18:45,880
I can ask exactly where she is and
exactly when she's coming back.

190
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:49,590
Yeah, I'll do that.

191
00:18:53,580 --> 00:18:56,900
Mom. Don't go.

192
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:03,390
Don't go, just stay here.

193
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:16,530
She'll be back when she's ready to come back.

194
00:19:24,720 --> 00:19:27,360
I think it's raining outside.

195
00:19:29,370 --> 00:19:32,100
You like it when it rains.

196
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:58,990
Did you finish your homework?

197
00:19:58,990 --> 00:20:01,200
Did you borrow clothes?

198
00:20:04,250 --> 00:20:06,160
You're still here?

199
00:20:10,220 --> 00:20:13,300
Let me see Eunchae.

200
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:18,200
You can't. It'll break our family apart if you do.

201
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:20,600
Let me see Eunchae.

202
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:31,360
Eunchae, are you all right?

203
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:35,190
When your father comes, I'll open
the door and give you some food.

204
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:40,470
Your father's not cruel enough
to kill his own daughter.

205
00:20:40,470 --> 00:20:45,100
He just did this to scare you.

206
00:20:45,100 --> 00:20:50,690
Wait a little longer. Just a little, okay?

207
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:54,490
What do we do, Mom?

208
00:20:56,860 --> 00:20:58,080
Why?

209
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:04,320
Yun's manager is out front.

210
00:21:05,370 --> 00:21:06,490
What?

211
00:21:06,490 --> 00:21:10,700
My heart's being ripped to shreds!

212
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:13,330
It's freezing outside. And raining.

213
00:21:13,330 --> 00:21:17,340
Open the door. Please.

214
00:21:17,340 --> 00:21:19,950
Please, open the door!

215
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:26,930
Sukchae, Minchae, Mom.

216
00:21:26,930 --> 00:21:29,900
Please, please.

217
00:21:29,900 --> 00:21:33,090
I'll just send him home, and I'll be right back.

218
00:21:33,090 --> 00:21:36,150
He shouldn't be out like that.

219
00:21:36,150 --> 00:21:39,130
He'll die if he's out there like that.

220
00:21:39,130 --> 00:21:42,520
Please...

221
00:21:52,600 --> 00:21:57,480
Mom, I think Eunchae's hitting
her head against the door.

222
00:21:57,480 --> 00:22:00,370
What do we do? What do we do?

223
00:22:00,370 --> 00:22:05,690
What's wrong with her now? Eunchae! Don't!

224
00:22:05,690 --> 00:22:09,470
Don't hit your head. Eunchae.

225
00:22:09,470 --> 00:22:12,760
Stop it! Don't, Eunchae!

226
00:22:55,150 --> 00:22:58,880
Did you put on some medicine?

227
00:23:01,450 --> 00:23:06,290
Did you put medicine on your forehead
where you got hurt?

228
00:23:10,650 --> 00:23:14,700
I knew it.

229
00:23:21,530 --> 00:23:28,920
So I got some medicine for my Blockhead.

230
00:25:34,780 --> 00:25:38,500
It might hurt a little. You can handle it.

231
00:25:52,160 --> 00:25:53,500
It stings, huh?

232
00:25:56,590 --> 00:25:57,850
No.

233
00:26:32,070 --> 00:26:37,670
My Blockhead. You're so ugly.

234
00:26:38,830 --> 00:26:44,990
Skinned forehead. Face full of bruises.

235
00:26:44,990 --> 00:26:49,560
You're so ugly I can't look at you.

236
00:26:49,560 --> 00:26:52,160
I won't look. You're too ugly!

237
00:26:58,770 --> 00:27:01,320
Smile. Just like that.

238
00:27:01,320 --> 00:27:05,720
You're tolerable to look at when you smile.
Actually, you look pretty.

239
00:27:06,510 --> 00:27:11,960
Not as pretty as the Miss Australia I used to date,

240
00:27:11,960 --> 00:27:14,740
but you look better than Shrek.

241
00:27:24,090 --> 00:27:26,910
Fine! We'll get a divorce! Let's get one!

242
00:27:26,910 --> 00:27:30,510
I'd rather get a divorce than see my daughter suffer.

243
00:27:30,510 --> 00:27:34,240
It's not Mom's fault. You can disown me.

244
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:37,130
I broke the lock with my hammer.

245
00:27:37,130 --> 00:27:39,930
You didn't break it on your own. Dad, I helped.

246
00:27:39,930 --> 00:27:42,380
You can disown me, too.

247
00:27:43,490 --> 00:27:47,680
What is it? What is it?

248
00:27:47,680 --> 00:27:50,390
Why are you acting as if you got struck by lightning?

249
00:27:50,390 --> 00:27:54,240
And why was Yun's manager waiting
in the rain to see Eunchae?

250
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:58,370
And why was Eunchae banging her
head on the door to see him?

251
00:28:01,030 --> 00:28:04,890
Tell me! I'm Eunchae's mother!

252
00:28:04,890 --> 00:28:09,000
I need to know what's going on with my daughter.
I want to know!

253
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:12,720
What on earth happened to Eunchae?

254
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:16,750
Eunchae.

255
00:28:16,750 --> 00:28:18,840
My goodness...

256
00:28:20,520 --> 00:28:23,400
The motel manager's so nice.

257
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:28,390
He gave us a line to hang clothes,
an iron, and let you borrow his pants.

258
00:28:28,390 --> 00:28:30,070
He's going to be blessed.

259
00:28:30,070 --> 00:28:32,800
I was Yun stylist for five years,

260
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:36,280
so I know a thing or two about wet clothes.

261
00:28:36,280 --> 00:28:38,740
I could get a doctorate in drying
if there was such a thing.

262
00:28:43,770 --> 00:28:45,250
Here, put it on.

263
00:29:00,130 --> 00:29:01,620
Are you scared?

264
00:29:03,870 --> 00:29:07,660
Are you scared about hearing my story?

265
00:29:07,660 --> 00:29:10,380
Is that why you're only showing me your back?

266
00:29:13,620 --> 00:29:14,920
No.

267
00:29:54,310 --> 00:29:58,500
I got shot at my wife's wedding.

268
00:29:59,660 --> 00:30:04,180
The bullet was lodged in a place
too dangerous to remove.

269
00:30:04,180 --> 00:30:10,980
The bullet is right here.

270
00:30:12,690 --> 00:30:14,190
Scary, huh?

271
00:30:18,610 --> 00:30:22,310
Good. It's nothing to be afraid of.

272
00:30:24,030 --> 00:30:27,780
It's the same with death. It's not scary.

273
00:30:27,780 --> 00:30:33,340
It's a normal part of life. Everyone dies.

274
00:30:37,460 --> 00:30:42,990
It shouldn't be something
to get serious about or feel pity over.

275
00:30:44,930 --> 00:30:50,300
Wait. Saying that doesn't do me any good.

276
00:30:50,990 --> 00:30:54,670
I take it back. I take back everything I just said.

277
00:30:56,060 --> 00:31:00,010
I'm really sad. I'm very sad.

278
00:31:00,010 --> 00:31:02,820
You'll never find someone with a sadder story.

279
00:31:02,820 --> 00:31:04,630
I have the saddest life ever.

280
00:31:04,630 --> 00:31:13,000
So pity me. Don't be mean. Because I'm so pitiful...

281
00:31:34,690 --> 00:31:41,790
You're not pitiful at all.

282
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:47,530
Your heart is so full of love that

283
00:31:47,530 --> 00:31:55,600
you even took a bullet for a woman who betrayed you.

284
00:31:57,570 --> 00:32:02,890
You have so much.
What's sad about that?

285
00:32:05,910 --> 00:32:10,940
I don't pity you.

286
00:32:12,930 --> 00:32:16,160
I've never looked at you with pity.

287
00:32:18,210 --> 00:32:23,200
And I never will.

288
00:33:42,740 --> 00:33:44,460
Does it hurt a lot?

289
00:33:45,260 --> 00:33:47,100
Are you okay?

290
00:33:56,520 --> 00:34:01,020
Open the door. Let me in.

291
00:34:01,020 --> 00:34:03,290
Let me in, Mister.

292
00:34:05,940 --> 00:34:10,290
I'm fine. I'm fine.

293
00:34:11,480 --> 00:34:13,010
I'm fine.

294
00:34:14,580 --> 00:34:17,510
Please, open the door.

295
00:34:17,510 --> 00:34:19,750
I'll go in.

296
00:34:19,750 --> 00:34:23,990
It's embarrassing. You can't.

297
00:34:23,990 --> 00:34:26,090
I'll be out in a second.

298
00:34:26,090 --> 00:34:28,150
I'll be out soon.

299
00:35:06,580 --> 00:35:11,540
Eunchae, go home.

300
00:35:14,210 --> 00:35:24,110
Go home. What if your family
falls apart because of this?

301
00:35:25,600 --> 00:35:27,220
Go home.

302
00:35:28,710 --> 00:35:30,500
Let me just see your face first.

303
00:35:30,500 --> 00:35:32,400
Go, Eunchae.

304
00:35:33,080 --> 00:35:36,360
I'll go after I see your face.

305
00:35:39,710 --> 00:35:41,340
No.

306
00:35:43,210 --> 00:35:50,370
I'm so ugly that I don't want you to see me!

307
00:35:51,220 --> 00:35:52,560
Go.

308
00:35:53,720 --> 00:35:55,680
Mister.

309
00:35:59,790 --> 00:36:07,360
If I go, it'll be hard for me to come back.

310
00:36:12,510 --> 00:36:15,990
I can't just ignore Yun.

311
00:36:15,990 --> 00:36:18,250
I can't.

312
00:36:20,060 --> 00:36:25,170
I can't go and leave Yun now.

313
00:36:28,260 --> 00:36:31,200
I made Yun like that.

314
00:36:34,710 --> 00:36:43,410
I put a nail in Yun's heart
because I want to be with you.

315
00:36:47,100 --> 00:36:50,450
Because I want to take your hand.

316
00:36:51,700 --> 00:36:56,840
I made Yun like that because I wanted to be with you.

317
00:37:03,490 --> 00:37:05,800
I'm sorry.

318
00:37:08,580 --> 00:37:16,370
There was so much I wanted to give you.

319
00:37:21,550 --> 00:37:25,810
But I've only given you pain.

320
00:37:29,320 --> 00:37:32,530
I have nothing to give but that.

321
00:37:34,480 --> 00:37:38,870
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

322
00:39:39,610 --> 00:39:41,250
Dad...

323
00:39:43,950 --> 00:39:48,630
I know what you're worried about.

324
00:39:49,940 --> 00:39:54,990
Don't make the family suffer because of me.

325
00:39:57,700 --> 00:40:00,510
I'll take care of everything.

326
00:40:03,610 --> 00:40:05,120
Goodnight.

327
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:10,320
It's my fault.

328
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:19,800
I'm sorry, Eunchae.

329
00:42:16,930 --> 00:42:18,380
Vital signs.

330
00:42:20,340 --> 00:42:24,130
Mrs. Oh, may I have a word with you?

331
00:42:53,490 --> 00:42:58,900
Yun's health is not stable.

332
00:42:58,900 --> 00:43:09,630
And the person who was going to
donate the heart changed his mind.

333
00:43:38,500 --> 00:43:39,880
Thank you.

334
00:43:41,070 --> 00:43:43,670
The presents that you sent last time...

335
00:43:43,670 --> 00:43:48,870
My sister's clothes, meat, coal, fruits.

336
00:43:48,870 --> 00:43:53,340
We're wearing it, using it,
and eating it very thankfully.

337
00:43:55,620 --> 00:43:59,790
I'm taking the vitamins diligently, too.

338
00:43:59,790 --> 00:44:01,730
And the medicine.

339
00:44:03,060 --> 00:44:07,240
I'm taking the medicine that's good for the heart.

340
00:44:07,240 --> 00:44:11,580
But I took some tests today and

341
00:44:11,580 --> 00:44:16,590
they said my heart's so healthy
that I don't need to take them.

342
00:44:17,900 --> 00:44:22,720
Uh... I made a mistake.

343
00:44:22,720 --> 00:44:25,400
To tell you the truth, I was going
to give Yun that medicine.

344
00:44:25,400 --> 00:44:28,980
But I accidentally brought it to your house.

345
00:44:28,980 --> 00:44:34,580
The truth is, I won't be alive much longer.

346
00:44:34,580 --> 00:44:38,070
I might die on the streets today.

347
00:44:38,070 --> 00:44:41,210
I might not be able to wake up tomorrow morning.

348
00:44:41,210 --> 00:44:45,350
If I'm lucky, I might be able to
live for three or four months.

349
00:44:46,320 --> 00:44:47,910
Mr. Cha.

350
00:44:47,910 --> 00:44:49,950
So today, I went to the organ donation center.

351
00:44:52,080 --> 00:44:56,140
And registered to become a donor.

352
00:44:59,050 --> 00:45:03,210
Yun and I are the same blood type.

353
00:45:03,210 --> 00:45:08,890
Test results show Yun and I are
very compatible in all respects.

354
00:45:10,230 --> 00:45:15,980
Well... Mr. Cha, what are you trying
to tell me right now?

355
00:45:15,980 --> 00:45:21,610
If I die first,

356
00:45:21,610 --> 00:45:25,730
I want to give my heart to Yun.

357
00:45:30,080 --> 00:45:33,310
Why are you doing this, Mr. Cha?
I don't know what you heard,

358
00:45:33,310 --> 00:45:36,850
but it's seriously a mistake. Mistake. Huh?

359
00:45:40,300 --> 00:45:42,960
Oh, fine. I...

360
00:45:44,920 --> 00:45:50,500
Because of my child, I was nuts for a while. Really.

361
00:45:52,410 --> 00:45:58,300
Okay, I really was nuts.

362
00:45:58,300 --> 00:46:02,180
I don't want it.

363
00:46:02,180 --> 00:46:04,180
I won't take it. All right?

364
00:46:04,180 --> 00:46:07,470
I don't want to. I really don't want it.

365
00:46:08,410 --> 00:46:10,140
I don't want to.

366
00:46:13,460 --> 00:46:17,650
The clothes that you bought for
my sister were very pretty.

367
00:46:48,250 --> 00:46:49,710
Mother,

368
00:46:52,420 --> 00:46:54,520
please don't cry.

369
00:46:55,640 --> 00:47:01,520
What I want is not your tears.

370
00:47:01,520 --> 00:47:03,570
Please, don't cry.

371
00:47:05,920 --> 00:47:07,350
What's wrong?

372
00:47:11,780 --> 00:47:16,170
Why are you crying? Mom?

373
00:47:16,170 --> 00:47:21,000
If those tears of yours are for me...

374
00:47:23,160 --> 00:47:27,120
then please don't cry.

375
00:47:35,400 --> 00:47:48,340
For now on, the tears you shed
will be my tears of blood.

376
00:47:52,020 --> 00:47:54,970
[Cha Muhyeok, signed donor]

377
00:49:19,220 --> 00:49:22,000
Now, the best manager!

378
00:49:22,000 --> 00:49:24,830
Introducing Muhyeok!

379
00:49:26,600 --> 00:49:33,950
I'm Choi Yun's famous manager, Cha Muhyeok!

380
00:49:33,950 --> 00:49:38,240
This is Yun, Muhyeok's eternal fan!

381
00:49:38,240 --> 00:49:40,420
Are you the person who rescued us?

382
00:49:40,420 --> 00:49:43,260
You don't have a brother right?

383
00:49:43,260 --> 00:49:45,720
Do you want to be my brother?

384
00:49:45,720 --> 00:49:47,790
I wouldn't have lived without you, right?

385
00:49:47,790 --> 00:49:50,270
I wouldn't be able to eat,
wouldn't be able to go to the bathroom.

386
00:49:50,270 --> 00:49:51,760
That's right!

387
00:49:51,760 --> 00:49:55,220
Speaking of eating, don't mind if I have a bite myself!

388
00:49:56,390 --> 00:49:57,700
Ah! Don't!

389
00:50:09,940 --> 00:50:15,010
Now, the girl I'm about to introduce!

390
00:50:15,010 --> 00:50:17,690
Wait a second.

391
00:50:21,470 --> 00:50:26,400
Looks like she's eating something all by herself.

392
00:50:26,400 --> 00:50:28,720
Like a little fool, she's laughing by herself.

393
00:50:28,720 --> 00:50:31,590
- Wake up, fool!
- Blockhead!

394
00:50:33,290 --> 00:50:34,370
Blockhead!

395
00:50:34,370 --> 00:50:38,210
What are you doing? Stop!

396
00:51:15,220 --> 00:51:17,480
How was your trip?

397
00:51:18,530 --> 00:51:19,870
Yeah.

398
00:51:20,490 --> 00:51:22,700
I thought it was going to take a long time.

399
00:51:25,570 --> 00:51:28,550
I thought so, too,

400
00:51:30,350 --> 00:51:32,760
But I came back quickly.

401
00:51:48,220 --> 00:51:49,740
Uncle!

402
00:51:50,820 --> 00:51:53,950
Grandpa said that he's going
to take pictures of you and me

403
00:51:53,950 --> 00:51:56,190
and wants you to come outside.

404
00:51:57,690 --> 00:52:00,840
What are you doing? Go sit down by your sister.

405
00:52:00,840 --> 00:52:04,280
Here! Here! Here!

406
00:52:04,280 --> 00:52:05,950
What are you doing?

407
00:52:05,950 --> 00:52:08,180
Are you deaf?

408
00:52:08,180 --> 00:52:10,020
Why do you want to take pictures all of a sudden?

409
00:52:10,020 --> 00:52:12,220
I'm taking pictures because
I need to use it for something.

410
00:52:12,220 --> 00:52:14,140
Go sit down.

411
00:52:14,140 --> 00:52:16,660
You may not believe it, but I've
been taking pictures for years.

412
00:52:16,660 --> 00:52:17,860
Just trust me.

413
00:52:17,860 --> 00:52:20,070
Why are you taking the picture?

414
00:52:20,070 --> 00:52:24,220
I'm going to put it in a book.

415
00:52:24,220 --> 00:52:28,670
I have a book that I'm finishing up
right now. I need it to finish.

416
00:52:28,670 --> 00:52:30,660
What book is it?

417
00:52:30,660 --> 00:52:35,130
The book of movie star Audrey and her three children.

418
00:52:35,130 --> 00:52:36,860
Do you want to take a picture?

419
00:52:36,860 --> 00:52:40,470
I took individual pictures,

420
00:52:40,470 --> 00:52:43,880
but I don't have a group picture. That's why.

421
00:52:46,000 --> 00:52:49,360
Do you want to take it?
You don't want a picture?

422
00:52:54,320 --> 00:52:55,750
I'll take it.

423
00:53:02,880 --> 00:53:06,180
But can I make V signs?

424
00:53:06,180 --> 00:53:07,280
Do whatever.

425
00:53:07,280 --> 00:53:09,850
Muhyeok, get in closer.

426
00:53:10,650 --> 00:53:12,900
Okay. One, two.

427
00:53:25,900 --> 00:53:28,750
It's great.

428
00:53:28,750 --> 00:53:30,810
Mother.

429
00:53:30,810 --> 00:53:35,200
For now, please hold back your tears.

430
00:53:35,200 --> 00:53:40,620
Your tears will become tears of blood for me.

431
00:53:45,400 --> 00:53:47,060
Eunchae.

432
00:53:48,040 --> 00:53:49,400
Eunchae!

433
00:53:54,790 --> 00:53:56,140
Eunchae!

434
00:53:57,970 --> 00:53:59,520
Yes?

435
00:53:59,520 --> 00:54:02,040
- Go home.
- What?

436
00:54:02,040 --> 00:54:06,160
I want to be alone today. Go home.

437
00:54:06,160 --> 00:54:07,400
Yun.

438
00:54:07,400 --> 00:54:11,060
I want to listen to music.

439
00:54:11,060 --> 00:54:15,520
I just want to be alone. Please.

440
00:54:34,120 --> 00:54:35,790
Blockhead!

441
00:54:40,180 --> 00:54:42,700
- Mister!
- Blockhead!

442
00:55:19,850 --> 00:55:21,570
Enjoy.

443
00:55:35,190 --> 00:55:37,090
Hey, Cha Muhyeok!

444
00:55:58,040 --> 00:55:59,500
Hey.

445
00:56:01,020 --> 00:56:02,780
Cha Muhyeok.

446
00:56:04,350 --> 00:56:05,710
Hey.

447
00:56:06,770 --> 00:56:09,450
Fine, let's do it then.

448
00:56:09,450 --> 00:56:12,640
Let's see how far Kang Minju will ruin herself.

449
00:56:12,640 --> 00:56:15,600
How pathetic I can get.

450
00:56:15,600 --> 00:56:18,370
I want to know what my limit is.

451
00:56:19,310 --> 00:56:21,430
Let's do it, Cha Muhyeok!

452
00:56:28,820 --> 00:56:30,000
Muhyeok.

453
00:56:33,300 --> 00:56:36,360
I'd have waited ten more minutes then left.

454
00:56:36,360 --> 00:56:38,330
Are you allowed to be out like this?

455
00:56:38,330 --> 00:56:43,170
Nope. They probably turned the hospital
upside-down to find me.

456
00:56:43,170 --> 00:56:46,880
Go back. Should I take you?

457
00:56:46,880 --> 00:56:48,600
I came to say something.

458
00:56:48,600 --> 00:56:50,570
I don't really want to hear anything.

459
00:56:50,570 --> 00:56:53,040
I heard from my mom.

460
00:56:54,510 --> 00:56:59,500
That you said you want to give me your heart.

461
00:57:00,590 --> 00:57:03,180
You don't have to thank me.

462
00:57:03,180 --> 00:57:05,680
That's not how it's done.

463
00:57:05,680 --> 00:57:07,470
Let's go. I'll take you back.

464
00:57:07,470 --> 00:57:12,960
What are you trying to get me to do?

465
00:57:14,150 --> 00:57:20,110
Kill you so that I can live?

466
00:57:20,110 --> 00:57:23,020
What are you doing to me?

467
00:57:23,020 --> 00:57:26,090
No. I don't want it.

468
00:57:26,090 --> 00:57:29,360
I'd rather die. I don't want it!

469
00:57:30,680 --> 00:57:32,800
I came to say that.

470
00:57:35,530 --> 00:57:37,170
Why don't you want it?

471
00:57:38,900 --> 00:57:41,830
It's not like I'm dying for you.

472
00:57:41,830 --> 00:57:44,480
I'm going to die regardless.

473
00:57:44,480 --> 00:57:48,240
I want to do something good and end up in heaven.

474
00:57:48,240 --> 00:57:50,900
Why? Are you jealous of that as well?

475
00:57:50,900 --> 00:57:54,900
Then give it to someone else.

476
00:57:54,900 --> 00:57:57,650
Why me?

477
00:57:57,650 --> 00:57:59,870
Why does it have to be me?

478
00:58:01,860 --> 00:58:06,140
Because I'm your brother.

479
00:58:10,180 --> 00:58:15,200
You're my little brother, and I'm your big brother.

480
00:58:28,688 --> 00:58:29,725
[Episode 14 Preview]

481
00:58:29,725 --> 00:58:34,679
I told you I'd give it to you even
if you don't give me anything.

482
00:58:34,679 --> 00:58:41,783
Even if you don't beg me, I've told you already
I'm going to give it to you before I die!

483
00:58:43,511 --> 00:58:48,119
[Sorry, but you don't see me]

484
00:58:51,950 --> 00:58:55,962
Kill you so that I can live?

485
00:58:55,962 --> 00:58:56,775
[Love, but I'm in love with you]
Mother...

486
00:58:57,472 --> 00:59:01,372
Mother, I'm the son you abandoned.
